<title>USA: J &amp; J Snack buys assets of Pa. pretzel co.</title>
<headline>J &amp; J Snack buys assets of Pa. pretzel co.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>J &amp; J Snack Foods Corp said Thursday that it has acquired the assets of  Bakers Best Snack Food Corp of Hatfield, Pennsylvania, for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Bakers Best is a soft pretzel manufacturer with annual sales of about $4 million, the company said.</p>
